    "Up Arrow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pfeil nach oben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update aOS on the Mac to keep this terminal when the connection drops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktualisiere aOS auf dem Mac, damit dieses Terminal bleibt, wenn die Verbindung abreißt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a login from another password app below, or decline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nimm unten eine Anmeldung aus einer anderen Passwort-App, oder lehne ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the password for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Passwort für %@ verwenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benutzer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benutzer %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name or email" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benutzername oder E-Mail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Viewer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ansicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the network" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf das Netzwerk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf dich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waits for you on the Mac (trust the folder)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf dem Mac auf dich (Ordner vertrauen)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is where" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was ist wo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While a terminal is open and connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solange ein Terminal offen und verbunden ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the lid is open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solange der Deckel offen ist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you watch, the workspace's screen takes the shape of your iPhone, upright or sideways. It gets its own size back when you stop. Retina draws twice the pixels: sharper, more data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Während du zusiehst, nimmt der Bildschirm des Arbeitsplatzes die Form deines iPhones an, hochkant oder quer. Wenn du aufhörst, bekommt er seine eigene Größe zurück. Retina zeichnet doppelt so viele Pixel: schärfer, mehr Daten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without Bitwarden, your password app's AutoFill fills the fields in the request; aOS sends them once, encrypted over SSH, and doesn't keep them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne Bitwarden füllt das automatische Ausfüllen deiner Passwort-App die Felder der Anfrage; aOS sendet sie einmal, verschlüsselt über SSH, und behält sie nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "worked last" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "zuletzt erreicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspace" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arbeitsplatz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspace request" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anfrage für den Arbeitsplatz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agent asks, you approve with Face ID. It never sees the password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Agent fragt, du gibst mit Face ID frei. Er sieht das Passwort nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agent is using it for „%@“. Its work there stops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Agent nutzt ihn für „%@“. Seine Arbeit dort hört auf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agent never sees a password. aOS fills it into the workspace for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Agent sieht nie ein Passwort. aOS trägt es für dich im Arbeitsplatz ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac and the workspace, live, with touch and keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Mac und der Arbeitsplatz, live, mit Touch und Tastatur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac's screen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bildschirm deines Macs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "your network (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dein Netzwerk (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your password app (1Password, Passwords, Bitwarden's app) fills these fields with its own Face ID. aOS sends them once and doesn't keep them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Passwort-App (1Password, Passwörter, die App von Bitwarden) füllt diese Felder mit ihrem eigenen Face ID. aOS sendet sie einmal und behält sie nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your passwords" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Passwörter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your passwords stay in Bitwarden. aOS on your Mac gets only the login you approve, right before it fills it in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Passwörter bleiben in Bitwarden. aOS auf deinem Mac holt nur die Anmeldung, die du freigibst, direkt bevor es sie einträgt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your passwords stay in Bitwarden. You approve every sign-in with Face ID." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Passwörter bleiben in Bitwarden. Jede Anmeldung gibst du mit Face ID frei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Herauszoomen"
          }
        }
      }
    }
